<title>ISRAEL: Africa Israel Q1 net down.</title>
<headline>Africa Israel Q1 net down.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Africa Israel Investments Ltd reported the following results to the Tel Aviv Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>			   (in thousands of shekels)</p>
<p>			   Q1 97	Q1 96</p>
<p>Revenue		  239,039    262,504</p>
<p>Pretax profit	   17,590     41,275</p>
<p>Net profit		14,065     37,085</p>
<p>($1=3.395 shekels)</p>
<p>-Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
</text>
